{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":18,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"e7c2071b-3eed-43d6-b96d-3b3aa3df768d","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":150943141,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"前端开发工程师(J10064)","OrgId":945472,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 负责公司Web端及移动端产品的前端页面开发，确保页面的良好展示和用户体验；\r\n2. 负责前端代码的编写、调试、测试和维护，并与后端开发工程师协同工作，保证前后端交互的顺畅；\r\n3. 负责前端组件库的开发、扩展和维护；\r\n4. 关注前端技术的最新发展趋势，积极学习并应用新技术，提高团队的技术水平。","Require":"1、本科以上学历，计算机相关专业；\r\n2、精通Javascript、html、css、Node.js等前端开发技术，基础扎实；\r\n3、熟悉当下主流的前端框架(主要是vue2、vue3等)；\r\n4、熟悉HTTP、TCP/IP协议；\r\n5、熟练掌握 PC/H5(移动端) 开发、熟悉主流浏览器的技术特点；\r\n6、熟悉常见的页面性能优化以及主流浏览器的兼容性优化；\r\n7、熟悉前端工程的构建、打包、部署，熟练使用webpack、vite等打包构建工具；\r\n8、具有良好的编码习惯；","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2024-09-12T15:17:31","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"34bbf47f-a77e-4209-99c7-22636a699653","HeadCount":0,"JobAd